          "en": "Dear respected tourists, good morning! Welcome to the beautiful Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region. I'm Vivian, your tour guide for this \"Guangxi Tea Culture Tour\". It's a great honor to accompany you on this fragrant journey. During the upcoming trip, we will start from Wuzhou, pass through Guigang and Nanning, and finally arrive in Fangchenggang. We will explore the unique charms of Wuzhou Liubao Tea, Guiping Xishan Tea, Hengzhou Jasmine Tea and Fangchenggang Golden Camellia. Please feel free to tell me if you have any needs during the trip. I hope you can taste the tea fragrance and experience the customs among the green mountains and clear waters of Guangxi.",
          "cn": "各位尊敬的游客朋友们，大家早上好！欢迎来到美丽的广西壮族自治区，我是大家本次“广西茶文化之旅”的导游Vivian，非常荣幸能陪伴大家开启这段茶香四溢的旅程。在接下来的行程中，我们将从梧州出发，途经贵港、南宁，最终抵达防城港，一同探寻梧州六堡茶、桂平西山茶、横州茉莉花茶和防城金花茶的独特魅力。旅途中有任何需求，都请随时告诉我，希望大家能在广西的青山绿水间，品味茶香，感受风情。"
