        {
          "title": "",
          "en": "Next, let's introduce the cities on our itinerary. The first stop is Wuzhou, located in the east of Guangxi, which is the east gate of Guangxi. It covers a total area of 12,600 square kilometers with a permanent population of about 2.82 million. Wuzhou is a millennium-old city and also a famous \"hometown of Liubao Tea\" in China. In addition, Guiling Jelly and Paper-wrapped Chicken are unique delicacies here. The second stop is Guigang, located in the southeast of Guangxi, covering a total area of 10,600 square kilometers with a permanent population of about 4.35 million. It is the birthplace of Guiping Xishan Tea, which is famous for its \"green color, strong fragrance, sweet taste and beautiful shape\". The third stop is Nanning, the capital of Guangxi, located in the south-central part of Guangxi. It covers a total area of 22,100 square kilometers with a permanent population of about 8.89 million and is the political, economic and cultural center of Guangxi. Hengzhou, a county-level city under the jurisdiction of Nanning, is the \"hometown of jasmine in China\" and its jasmine tea is famous all over the country. The fourth stop is Fangchenggang, located in the south of Guangxi, bordering Beibu Gulf in the south. It covers a total area of 6,200 square kilometers with a permanent population of about 1.05 million. The golden camellia here is a national first-class protected plant, known as the \"giant panda in the plant kingdom\" and \"queen of the tea family\".",
          "cn": "接下来介绍我们的行程城市。第一站梧州，位于广西东部，是广西东大门，总面积1.26万平方公里，常住人口约282万。梧州是千年古城，也是中国著名的“六堡茶之乡”，此外龟苓膏、纸包鸡等美食独具特色。第二站贵港，地处广西东南部，总面积1.06万平方公里，常住人口约435万，这里是桂平西山茶的发源地，西山茶以“色翠、香高、味甘、形美”闻名。第三站南宁，作为广西首府，位于广西中南部，总面积2.21万平方公里，常住人口约889万，是广西政治、经济、文化中心，横州作为南宁代管县级市，是“中国茉莉花之乡”，茉莉花茶香飘万里。第四站防城港，位于广西南部，南临北部湾，总面积0.62万平方公里，常住人口约105万，这里的金花茶是国家一级保护植物，有“植物界大熊猫”“茶族皇后”的美誉。"
        },
        {
          "title": "三、景点及茶品介绍（Introduction to Scenic Spots and Teas）",
          "en": "Our tea culture tour will start with Wuzhou Liubao Tea. As a representative of Chinese dark tea, Wuzhou Liubao Tea has a history of more than 1,500 years and is named after its origin in Liubao Town, Wuzhou. In the Liubao Tea producing area, we can visit ancient tea factories, see the traditional pile fermentation and aging processes, and also brew a cup of Liubao Tea by ourselves to experience its unique flavor of \"red, thick, mellow and aged\". Liubao Tea not only has a mellow taste, but also has the effects of dispelling dampness and nourishing the stomach, which is very suitable for drinking in the humid climate of southern China.",
          "cn": "我们的茶文化之旅将从梧州六堡茶开始。梧州六堡茶是中国黑茶类的代表，有着1500多年的历史，因产于梧州六堡镇而得名。在六堡茶产区，我们可以参观古老的茶厂，看到传统的渥堆、陈化工艺，还能亲手冲泡一杯六堡茶，感受它“红、浓、醇、陈”的独特风味。六堡茶不仅口感醇厚，还具有祛湿养胃的功效，非常适合南方湿润气候饮用。"
        },
        {
          "title": "",
          "en": "Then we will go to Guiping Xishan in Guigang. It is not only a national scenic spot, but also the core producing area of Guiping Xishan Tea. Xishan is not high in altitude, but it has a mild climate, lingering clouds and mist, and fertile soil, providing an excellent environment for tea tree growth. We will climb Xishan, walk in the tea garden, and enjoy the beautiful scenery of \"good scenery in the mountain and good taste in the tea\". We can also taste the freshly picked and fried Xishan Tea in the mountain tea house. Its tea soup is clear and bright, with a fresh and sweet taste that lingers on the aftertaste.",
          "cn": "接着前往贵港桂平西山，这里不仅是国家级风景名胜区，更是桂平西山茶的核心产区。西山海拔不高，但气候温和、云雾缭绕，土壤肥沃，为茶树生长提供了绝佳环境。我们将登上西山，在茶园中漫步，欣赏“山有好景，茶有佳味”的美景，还能在山间茶舍品尝刚采摘炒制的西山茶，其茶汤清澈明亮，滋味鲜爽回甘，让人回味无穷。"
        },
        {
          "title": "",
          "en": "The third stop is Hengzhou, Nanning. We will visit the jasmine planting base and flower tea processing factory. Hengzhou has the largest jasmine planting area in the world. Every July to August, millions of mu of jasmine flowers bloom, and the fragrance fills the whole small city. In the base, we can learn the picking skills of jasmine flowers - the flower buds that are in bud must be picked in the early morning to retain the strongest fragrance. In the processing factory, we can see the whole process of scenting jasmine flowers with green tea. A cup of Hengzhou Jasmine Tea has both the freshness of green tea and the fragrance of jasmine, which is a model of \"flowers bring tea fragrance and tea carries flower charm\".",
          "cn": "第三站南宁横州，我们将参观茉莉花种植基地和花茶加工厂。横州拥有全球最大的茉莉花种植面积，每年7-8月，百万亩茉莉花开，香气弥漫整个小城。在基地里，我们可以了解茉莉花的采摘技巧——必须在清晨采摘含苞待放的花蕾，才能保留最浓郁的香气。在加工厂，能看到茉莉花与绿茶窨制的全过程，一杯横州茉莉花茶，既有绿茶的清爽，又有茉莉的芬芳，是“花引茶香，茶承花韵”的典范。"
        },
        {
          "title": "",
          "en": "The last stop is Fangchenggang, where we will visit the Golden Camellia Nature Reserve. Different from other teas, the golden camellia has golden flowers and thick, shiny petals, like carved gold. It was not discovered until 1960 and is a rare tea species in the world. In the reserve, we can watch clusters of golden camellia trees, learn about their growth habits and protection history, and also taste the tea soup brewed with golden camellia. Its soup color is golden and bright, the taste is fresh and refreshing, and it is highly favored because it is rich in various nutrients.",
          "cn": "最后一站防城港，我们将探访金花茶自然保护区。金花茶与其他茶叶不同，花色金黄，花瓣厚实有光泽，宛如黄金雕琢，1960年才被发现，是世界珍稀茶种。在保护区内，我们可以观赏到成片的金花茶树林，了解其生长习性和保护历程，还能品尝到用金花茶冲泡的茶汤，其汤色金黄明亮，滋味鲜爽，更因富含多种营养成分而备受青睐。"
        },
        {
          "title": "四、欢送词（Farewell Speech）",
          "en": "Dear tourists, our \"Guangxi Tea Culture Tour\" is coming to an end. From the mellow and aged fragrance of Wuzhou Liubao Tea, to the fresh and sweet aftertaste of Guiping Xishan Tea, from the fragrant and elegant Hengzhou Jasmine Tea, to the rare and unique Fangchenggang Golden Camellia, I believe you have not only tasted the charm of Guangxi's famous teas, but also felt the beauty of Guangxi's mountains and waters and ethnic customs. This journey is more wonderful because of your company. Thank you for your cooperation and support. The tea fragrance of Guangxi will always float for you. Welcome to the beautiful Guangxi again. Wish you a safe and pleasant journey!",
          "cn": "各位游客朋友们，我们的“广西茶文化之旅”即将结束。从梧州六堡茶的醇厚陈香，到桂平西山茶的鲜爽回甘，从横州茉莉花茶的芬芳清雅，到防城港金花茶的珍稀独特，相信大家不仅品尝到了广西名茶的魅力，更感受到了广西的山水之美和民族风情。这段旅程因为有大家的陪伴而更加精彩，感谢大家的配合与支持。广西的茶香永远为大家飘溢，欢迎大家再次来到美丽的广西，祝大家一路平安，旅途愉快！"
        }
