      "category": "应变处理问答",
      "enQuestion": "Due to objective reasons, the tour group has to leave a place in advance. How should the tour guide handle it?",
      "cnQuestion": "由于客观原因，旅游团要提前离开某地，导游员应如何处理？",
      "question": "Due to objective reasons, the tour group has to leave a place in advance. How should the tour guide handle it?",
      "answer": "(1) Try to seize the time to complete the planned visits and tours. If there are difficulties, the local guide should have a contingency plan and focus on visiting the most representative and characteristic tourist attractions in the local area;\n(2) Do a good job in comforting the tourists, truthfully explain the difficulties, sincerely apologize, and seek forgiveness;\n(3) Report to the travel agency and connect with the driver to promptly go through the procedures of checking out of the hotel, canceling meals, and returning the vehicle;\n(4) If the group's activities are greatly affected and the tourists suffer significant losses and express strong dissatisfaction, the reception agency leader can be invited to coordinate and propose compensation measures;\n(5) Notify the operation and scheduling department to promptly inform the next stop and formulate a revised reception plan.",
      "enAnswer": "(1) Try to seize the time to complete the planned visits and tours. If there are difficulties, the local guide should have a contingency plan and focus on visiting the most representative and characteristic tourist attractions in the local area;\n(2) Do a good job in comforting the tourists, truthfully explain the difficulties, sincerely apologize, and seek forgiveness;\n(3) Report to the travel agency and connect with the driver to promptly go through the procedures of checking out of the hotel, canceling meals, and returning the vehicle;\n(4) If the group's activities are greatly affected and the tourists suffer significant losses and express strong dissatisfaction, the reception agency leader can be invited to coordinate and propose compensation measures;\n(5) Notify the operation and scheduling department to promptly inform the next stop and formulate a revised reception plan.",
      "cnAnswer": "（1）尽量抓紧时间，将计划内的参观游览安排完成。若有困难，地陪应有应变计划，重点游览本地最具代表性、最具特色的旅游景点；\n（2）做好游客安抚工作，实事求是说明困难、诚恳道歉，以求得原谅；\n（3）向旅行社报告并与司机衔接，及时办理退房、退餐、退车等事宜；\n（4）如果旅游团活动受到较大影响，游客损失较大而引起强烈不满，可请接待社领导出面协调，并提出补偿办法；\n（5）通知计调及时通知下一站，制订变更接待计划安排。"
