      "question": "Due to weather reasons, the flight cannot take off on time and is delayed until the evening. However, the airline announces the cancellation of the flight for the day at 10:00 p.m. The tourists are in low spirits and make a lot of noise, feeling very dissatisfied. How should the local tour guide handle it?",
      "answer": "(1) The local guide should promptly explain the situation to the tourists and work with the airline ground staff stationed at the airport to fully stabilize the tourists' emotions;\n(2) Connect with the operation and scheduling department to implement the flight for departure the next day as soon as possible and make arrangements for luggage, etc.;\n(3) Promptly solve the tourists' accommodation and catering problems;\n(4) Notify the tourists of the morning call time, breakfast time, luggage delivery time, and departure time for the next day;\n(5) Remind the travel agency's operation and scheduling department to promptly notify the next stop of the itinerary.",
      "enAnswer": "(1) The local guide should promptly explain the situation to the tourists and work with the airline ground staff stationed at the airport to fully stabilize the tourists' emotions;\n(2) Connect with the operation and scheduling department to implement the flight for departure the next day as soon as possible and make arrangements for luggage, etc.;\n(3) Promptly solve the tourists' accommodation and catering problems;\n(4) Notify the tourists of the morning call time, breakfast time, luggage delivery time, and departure time for the next day;\n(5) Remind the travel agency's operation and scheduling department to promptly notify the next stop of the itinerary.",
