      "category": "应变处理问答",
      "enQuestion": "Some tourists in the tour group experience symptoms such as vomiting, diarrhea, fatigue, and coma after eating seafood. How should the tour guide handle it?",
      "cnQuestion": "旅游团中部分游客因食用了海产品出现呕吐腹泻、乏力、昏迷症状，导游员应如何处理？",
      "question": "Some tourists in the tour group experience symptoms such as vomiting, diarrhea, fatigue, and coma after eating seafood. How should the tour guide handle it?",
      "answer": "These are symptoms of acute enteritis caused by food poisoning. If not rescued in time, it will be life-threatening. The tour guide should:\n(1) Immediately try to induce vomiting and let the patient drink more water to speed up excretion and relieve toxicity;\n(2) Immediately send the patient to the hospital for emergency treatment and ask the doctor to issue a diagnosis certificate;\n(3) Immediately report to the travel agency and pay attention to collecting on-site evidence to investigate the responsibility of the catering unit.",
      "enAnswer": "These are symptoms of acute enteritis caused by food poisoning. If not rescued in time, it will be life-threatening. The tour guide should:\n(1) Immediately try to induce vomiting and let the patient drink more water to speed up excretion and relieve toxicity;\n(2) Immediately send the patient to the hospital for emergency treatment and ask the doctor to issue a diagnosis certificate;\n(3) Immediately report to the travel agency and pay attention to collecting on-site evidence to investigate the responsibility of the catering unit.",
      "cnAnswer": "参考答案：\n这是食物中毒引起的急性肠炎症状，如果抢救不及时，会有生命危险。导游员应该：\n（1）立即设法催吐，并让患者多喝水以加速排泄，缓解毒性；\n（2）立即将患者送往医院抢救治疗，请医生开具诊断证明；\n（3）立即报告旅行社，注意收集现场证据以便追究供餐单位的责任。"
