      "id": 108,
      "officialCategory": "应变处理问答",
      "category": "应变处理问答",
      "enQuestion": "During the group tour, if a tourist suffers from heatstroke, how should the tour guide handle it?",
      "cnQuestion": "在团队游览中，如遇到游客中暑，导游员应如何处理？",
      "question": "During the group tour, if a tourist suffers from heatstroke, how should the tour guide handle it?",
      "answer": "(1) If there is a medical staff in the group, the tour guide should assist the medical staff in on-site first aid;\n(2) If there is no doctor in the group, with the help of the tourists, carry the patient to a cool place and do what is possible for first aid: let the patient lie flat, loosen clothes, and with the approval of the family members or accompanying personnel, let him take anti-heatstroke medicines such as Shidi Shui (a traditional Chinese medicine for relieving summer heat) or Rendan (a traditional Chinese medicine for relieving summer heat);\n(3) If the patient is in an unconscious state, immediately contact the scenic spot medical staff or the hospital for treatment.",
      "enAnswer": "(1) If there is a medical staff in the group, the tour guide should assist the medical staff in on-site first aid;\n(2) If there is no doctor in the group, with the help of the tourists, carry the patient to a cool place and do what is possible for first aid: let the patient lie flat, loosen clothes, and with the approval of the family members or accompanying personnel, let him take anti-heatstroke medicines such as Shidi Shui (a traditional Chinese medicine for relieving summer heat) or Rendan (a traditional Chinese medicine for relieving summer heat);\n(3) If the patient is in an unconscious state, immediately contact the scenic spot medical staff or the hospital for treatment.",
      "cnAnswer": "（1）如团队中有医务人员，导游应协助医务人员就地抢救；\n（2）如团队无医生，应在游客的协助下把患者抬到阴凉处，做力所能及的抢救工作：让患者平卧，放松衣物，在家属或同行人员的陪同认可下，服用十滴水、人丹或携带的其他防暑药品；\n（3）如患者处于昏迷不醒状态，则应立即联系景区医疗人员或医院前来救治。"
