      "id": 115,
      "officialCategory": "应变处理问答",
      "category": "应变处理问答",
      "enQuestion": "When checking out, the hotel staff finds that there is a small hole burned by a cigarette on the bed sheet in the tourist's room. The hotel requires compensation according to the price. How should the local guide handle it?",
      "cnQuestion": "在退房时，宾馆工作人员发现有游客房间的床单被香烟烧了一个小洞，宾馆要求按价赔偿，地陪导游员应如何处理？",
      "question": "When checking out, the hotel staff finds that there is a small hole burned by a cigarette on the bed sheet in the tourist's room. The hotel requires compensation according to the price. How should the local guide handle it?",
      "answer": "(1) First, distinguish the responsibility: whether the bed sheet had a hole originally or was caused by the guest. If it is determined to be caused by the guest, persuade him to compensate according to the price;\n(2) To avoid such incidents, the tour guide should remind the guests to take good care of various supplies and facilities in the guest room before the group checks in (when assigning rooms or issuing room cards), otherwise they should bear the corresponding consequences;\n(3) Remind the guests to carefully check whether the supporting supplies and facilities in the room are complete and intact after entering the room, and handle them in a timely manner if any problems are found to reduce unnecessary disputes.",
      "enAnswer": "(1) First, distinguish the responsibility: whether the bed sheet had a hole originally or was caused by the guest. If it is determined to be caused by the guest, persuade him to compensate according to the price;\n(2) To avoid such incidents, the tour guide should remind the guests to take good care of various supplies and facilities in the guest room before the group checks in (when assigning rooms or issuing room cards), otherwise they should bear the corresponding consequences;\n(3) Remind the guests to carefully check whether the supporting supplies and facilities in the room are complete and intact after entering the room, and handle them in a timely manner if any problems are found to reduce unnecessary disputes.",
      "cnAnswer": "参考答案：\n（1）首先分清责任，床单是原来就有破洞还是客人所为，如确定是客人所致，应说服其照价赔偿；\n（2）为了避免此类情况发生，导游员应在团队入住之前（分房或发放房卡时）叮嘱客人爱护客房内各种用品和设施，否则要承担相应后果；\n（3）提醒客人进入房间后应仔细检查房间的配套用品和设施是否齐全、完好，及时发现及时处理，以减少不必要的纠纷。"
