      "enQuestion": "In which cases should the tour guide dissuade tourists from free activities?",
      "cnQuestion": "哪些情况下，导游员应劝阻游客的自由活动？",
      "question": "In which cases should the tour guide dissuade tourists from free activities?",
      "answer": "(1) Before leaving the local area soon;\n(2) When the environment of the free activity poses hidden dangers to the personal and property safety of the tourists;\n(3) When the time for free activities cannot be guaranteed;\n(4) When free activities may affect the normal itinerary of the group;\n(5) Areas or institutions that are not open to the public.",
      "enAnswer": "(1) Before leaving the local area soon;\n(2) When the environment of the free activity poses hidden dangers to the personal and property safety of the tourists;\n(3) When the time for free activities cannot be guaranteed;\n(4) When free activities may affect the normal itinerary of the group;\n(5) Areas or institutions that are not open to the public.",
      "cnAnswer": "（1）即将启程离开本地前；\n（2）自由活动所处环境对游客的人身、财产安全有隐患时；\n（3）自由活动的时间无法保障时；\n（4）自由活动有可能会影响团队正常行程时；\n（5）不对外开放的地区、机构。"
