      "answer": "(1) Both parties should analyze calmly and carry out the work in the attitude of friendly cooperation between colleagues;\n(2) Each verify with the operation and scheduling department of their respective travel agencies, then quickly correct and reach a consensus to continue the subsequent itinerary;\n(3) During the process of handling the differences, avoid the group to prevent the tourists from feeling uneasy and distrustful.",
      "enAnswer": "(1) Both parties should analyze calmly and carry out the work in the attitude of friendly cooperation between colleagues;\n(2) Each verify with the operation and scheduling department of their respective travel agencies, then quickly correct and reach a consensus to continue the subsequent itinerary;\n(3) During the process of handling the differences, avoid the group to prevent the tourists from feeling uneasy and distrustful.",
      "cnAnswer": "参考答案：\n（1）双方应冷静分析，本着同行之间友好合作的态度开展工作；\n（2）各自向所属旅行社计调部核实，然后迅速更正、达成共识，继续后续行程；\n（3）处理分歧过程中，应避开团队，以免导致游客产生不安和不信任。"
