      "question": "What key details should the tour guide pay attention to in the work cooperation with the tourist bus driver?",
      "answer": "(1) Timely inform the driver of the travel activity information;\n(2) Assist the driver in doing a good job in safe driving;\n(3) Combine the schedule and consult the driver's opinions on the driving route;\n(4) Remind the driver to rest in time and not drive fatigued.",
