      "enQuestion": "In a hotel fire accident, if the group is surrounded by heavy smoke and fire, what are the main methods for the tour guide to guide the tourists to self-rescue?",
      "cnQuestion": "酒店火灾事故中，如果团队被大火和浓烟包围，导游人员引导游客自救的主要方法有哪些？",
      "question": "In a hotel fire accident, if the group is surrounded by heavy smoke and fire, what are the main methods for the tour guide to guide the tourists to self-rescue?",
      "answer": "(1) Accurately judge the fire situation, stabilize the tourists' emotions, and warn the tourists not to take the elevator to escape or jump off the building in panic;\n(2) According to the fire situation, lead the tourists to cover their mouths and noses with wet towels, keep their bodies as close to the ground as possible, and crawl along the base of the wall to escape;\n(3) If the body is on fire, roll on the spot to extinguish the flames, or press the flames with thick clothes;\n(4) If the door is closed by the fire, block the door crack with a wet cloth, pour water on the door to cool it down, and wait for rescue;\n(5) Wave colorful signs at the window of the floor to identify the position for the rescuers and seek rescue.",
      "enAnswer": "(1) Accurately judge the fire situation, stabilize the tourists' emotions, and warn the tourists not to take the elevator to escape or jump off the building in panic;\n(2) According to the fire situation, lead the tourists to cover their mouths and noses with wet towels, keep their bodies as close to the ground as possible, and crawl along the base of the wall to escape;\n(3) If the body is on fire, roll on the spot to extinguish the flames, or press the flames with thick clothes;\n(4) If the door is closed by the fire, block the door crack with a wet cloth, pour water on the door to cool it down, and wait for rescue;\n(5) Wave colorful signs at the window of the floor to identify the position for the rescuers and seek rescue.",
      "cnAnswer": "参考答案：\n（1）准确判断火情，稳定游客情绪，告诫游客不要乘坐电梯逃生或慌乱中跳楼逃生；\n（2）根据火情，可带领游客用湿润毛巾捂住口鼻，身子尽量贴近地面，沿墙根匍匐爬行逃生；\n（3）若身上着火，可就地打滚，将火苗压灭，或用厚重衣物压灭火苗；\n（4）如大火已封闭房门，可用湿布塞住门缝，往门上浇水降温，等待救援；\n（5）可在楼层窗口摇动色彩鲜艳的示意物，为救援人员标识位置，寻求救援。"
