      "enQuestion": "To prevent tourists from drowning accidents, what preventive work should the tour guide do?",
      "cnQuestion": "为防止游客溺水事故的发生，导游人员应如何做好预防工作？",
      "question": "To prevent tourists from drowning accidents, what preventive work should the tour guide do?",
      "answer": "(1) During group activities, pay more attention to the tourists' movements, and dissuade tourists (especially children) from playing alone by the river, lake, or sea;\n(2) Remind and dissuade tourists from swimming in non-swimming areas;\n(3) Remind and dissuade non-swimmers from entering the water;\n(4) Remind and supervise tourists to do appropriate warm-up exercises before swimming to prevent cramps;\n(5) Pay attention to observing the position of the lifeguard, and carry out rescue at the first time if any abnormal situation is found.",
      "enAnswer": "(1) During group activities, pay more attention to the tourists' movements, and dissuade tourists (especially children) from playing alone by the river, lake, or sea;\n(2) Remind and dissuade tourists from swimming in non-swimming areas;\n(3) Remind and dissuade non-swimmers from entering the water;\n(4) Remind and supervise tourists to do appropriate warm-up exercises before swimming to prevent cramps;\n(5) Pay attention to observing the position of the lifeguard, and carry out rescue at the first time if any abnormal situation is found.",
      "cnAnswer": "（1）团队活动时，多注意游客动向，劝阻游客（特别是儿童）切勿独自在河边、湖边、海边玩耍；\n（2）提醒、劝阻游客不得前往非游泳区游泳；\n（3）提醒、劝阻不会游泳者切勿下水；\n（4）提醒、督导游客在游泳前做适当的准备活动，以防抽筋；\n（5）注意观察救生员的位置，发现异常情况时，第一时间开展救援。"
